=====Derived terms=====
{{col|ja
|{{ja-r|蟻%群|ぎ%ぐん}}: a [[group]] of [[ant]]s
|{{ja-r|蟻%径|ぎ%けい}}: a [[narrow]] [[road]] or [[path]] (from the way that ants tend to travel in [[single file]])
|{{ja-r|蟻%穴|ぎ%けつ}}: an [[anthill]], a [[hole]] dug by [[ant]]s; a very small [[fault]] or [[mistake]]
|{{ja-r|蟻%蚕|ぎ%さん}}: a [[silkworm]] that has just [[hatched]] from its [[egg]] (from the superficial similarity to an ant)
|{{ja-r|蟻%酸|ぎ%さん}}: [[formic acid]]
|{{ja-r|蟻%酸%塩|ぎ%さん%えん}}: [[formate]]
|{{ja-r|蟻%集|ぎ%しゅう|rom=-}}, {{ja-r|蟻%聚|ぎ%しゅう}}: a large [[grouping]], as of many ants
|{{ja-r|蟻%走%感|ぎ%そう%かん}}: [[formication]]: a [[feeling]] as of many [[bug]]s crawling on one's skin
|{{ja-r|蟻付|ぎふ}}: a large [[grouping]] or [[gathering]] of [[people]], much as [[ant]]s will gather around something sweet
|{{ja-r|蟻%封|ぎ%ほう}}: an [[anthill]]
|{{ja-r|蟻%量|ぎ%りょう}}: “ant-weight”: the [[weight]] of a [[silkworm]] just after [[hatching]] from its egg (see {{ja-r|蟻%蚕|ぎ%さん|rom=-}} above)
|{{ja-r|蟻%垤|ぎ%てつ}}: an [[anthill]]
}}

